meta {
  name: Cancel a Shipment
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/external/orders/cancel/shipment/awbs
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
  "awbs": ["19041211125783"]
  }
}

docs {
  Use this API to cancel a created shipment before the "Out for Pickup" state. Multiple AWBs can be passed together as an array to cancel them simultaneously.

  **Limit: 2000 AWBs**

  ##### Parameters:

  | **PARAMS** | **REQUIRED** | **DATA TYPE** | **DESCRIPTION** | **EXAMPLE** |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | `awbs` | YES | _string_ | The AWB/List of AWBs that need to be canceled. | 19041211125783 |
}
